  "summary": "The source introduces and experimentally demonstrates a hybrid quantum-classical variational eigenvalue solver on an integrated photonic processor. Its central result is a proof-of-principle He-H+ molecular-energy calculation that trades QPE-style long coherent evolution for repeated short expectation-value measurements and classical optimization.",
